WEBVTT

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.260
Something I want?

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.610
That's right... October 
10th is coming up soon...

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.150
It's your birthday, Nagisa.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.630
Is there something you want for a present?

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.270
Let's see...

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.810
It would probably be...

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.820
Happy Birthday Misumi-san.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.280
Fuji-P's smile?

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:42.400
No way! No way! No way!

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.240
Nagisa?

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:51.640
No way! No way!

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.120
She doesn't seem to have anything she wants,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.190
so shall we just go out, and buy something?

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:49.810
I guess so.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.710
There's just no way that Fuji-P 
would celebrate my birthday...

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.750
It's just that impossible, isn't it?

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:01.440
It would never happen.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.170
October 10th...?

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.250
So that's Nagisa's birthday!

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.020
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.820
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.660
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.900
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.770
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.670
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:35.570
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.180
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.980
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:45.080
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.860
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.430
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.600
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.470
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:07.740
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:08.640
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:17.050
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.620
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.690
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:36.730
Stop poking me!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:40.640
Stop poking me! Stop poking me!

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:44.320
That power bothers me.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:49.540
Ilkubo and the others have no 
memory of a power that strong

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:51.900
coming from such a small creature.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.920
There's no use thinking about it.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.830
We need to take action.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.090
But... is it okay?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.160
Did you say something?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.420
Did you say something? Did you say something?

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.060
If you want to say something, 
just spit it out!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:12.370
Those girls are pretty hard to handle.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.170
You told me to tell you, so I told you...

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:19.790
We already know that,

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:26.110
but we were spawned from the 
strongest warrior, Jyaku-King.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.850
He heard what I said.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.100
Just you wait, Pretty Cure.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.390
Just you wait, Pretty Cure. 
Just you wait, Pretty Cure.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:43.300
"IS THIS A DATE? 
TUMULTUOUS HAPPY BIRTHDAY"

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:47.800
Good morning!

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:54.110
The new dark warriors have come after us 
to find the power of the Prism Stones.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.930
Before they realize that 
Pollun has the power,

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:02.040
we have to find Stone Keeper and 
restore it to the way it was before.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.950
Good morning, Nagisa!

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.190
Good morning.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.330
What's wrong? You seem to be lost in thought.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.680
This is for you...

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.190
It's a day early, but it's 
your birthday present.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.920
Thank you!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.400
Anything for you, Nagisa.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.070
That's right.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.030
That guy...?

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.410
Isn't that Hasekura-kun 
from the Boys' Division?

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.040
He's one of the hot players 
on the basketball team.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:27.810
You're right! He's so good-looking!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.600
Who?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.040
Hasekura-kun! Don't you know who he is?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.880
You're really behind the times, Nagisa...

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.190
He's super popular now.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.460
What is he doing?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.330
A single male standing at the 
gate of a girls' school...

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.160
Could it be he's here to confess his love?

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.800
He's coming over here...

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.330
It must be a confession!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.380
I wonder who...? Could it be me?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.680
Oh my god! What am I going to do?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.790
It probably has nothing to do with...

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.400
Misumi-san?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.600
Yes...?

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.270
I'm a second-year student 
in the Boys' Division.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.650
My name is Hasekura...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.610
Let me get right to the point.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.570
I love you... Please go out with me.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.610
What is it?

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.250
What's going on?

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.930
Hasekura-kun!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:12.000
What's going on, Nagisa?

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.850
He confessed his love to Nagisa.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.860
And it was... it was Hasekura-kun!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.660
No way!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.770
How did this happen?

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.490
How did you answer that guy 
who confessed his love to you?

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.210
Answer?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.790
I didn't answer him. I ran away.

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.180
Why did you run away?

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.690
Because I was shocked.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.150
You're not used to these things, 
so it can't be helped mepo.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.440
It's a miracle that someone actually 
confessed his love to Nagisa mepo.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.750
Be quiet!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.020
He's a good-looking basketball player mipo...

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.230
He has good taste... Choosing Nagisa mipo.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.920
But I have no intention 
of dating Hasekura-kun.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.200
Is it because you love someone else?

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.250
It's nothing like that!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:12.080
Lacrosse is my life, so I don't 
have time to be dating boys.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.200
Really?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.560
That's right.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.470
What should I do?

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.830
I don't know... if you don't 
intend to go out with him,

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.030
then you should turn him down.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:26.210
But if I do that, he'll be hurt.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.680
I don't want to do that to him.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.500
You're kind-hearted, aren't you, Nagisa.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.490
But when it comes to things like this,

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:35.420
if you leave it up in the air, 
you might hurt him even more.

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:38.780
It's better to be honest with him.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.240
I guess you're right...

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.530
Isn't that one of the girls 
on the lacrosse team?

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:48.790
I wonder if she's waiting for someone.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.570
Young love...

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:52.860
Now nice...

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.350
Honoka...

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.530
Misumi-san!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.340
We're going ahead, Hasekura.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.860
I'm sorry... I'll catch up with you.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.740
Misumi-san!

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.610
Were you waiting for me?

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.530
I'm so happy.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.130
I need to talk to...

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.890
Misumi-san? Do you like chestnuts?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:15.560
Chestnuts?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:21.120
I do.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.020
I'm glad. Let's go to 
pick chestnuts tomorrow.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:27.220
I go to pick chestnuts every year.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:30.940
The chestnuts rice that my 
grandma makes is the best.

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:32.980
But never mind that...

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.730
We'll meet at the bus stop in front of 
the station at nine tomorrow morning.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.640
The others are waiting 
for me, so I have to go.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.460
Sorry.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.360
Wait!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.480
He's really pushy, isn't he?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.290
I wish he'd listen!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.290
I guess you'll have to go tomorrow.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:52.750
The only way is for you to go with 
him tomorrow, and tell him then.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:57.530
But just the two of you going to pick 
chestnuts sounds like a date, doesn't it?

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.120
A date?

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.920
I can't sleep.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.370
It's like a date, isn't it?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:17.950
If it's a date, I wonder if 
I should make a bento lunch.

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.790
Take care of Pollun.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.220
What happened to your finger?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.400
I cut it.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:37.430
What is it?

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:39.780
Please, Honoka! Come with me.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.570
It'll give me courage to have you with me.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:45.990
It's my birthday today... So please do it.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:50.130
I can't... Hasekura-kun just invited you,

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.990
so if I come along, it 
would be rude, wouldn't it?

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.170
It'll be okay.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.010
Nagisa!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.850
Go on...

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.420
Nagisa seems different than usual mipo.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.660
She's usually too full of energy,

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.870
but not when it comes to things like this.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.510
Igaiga... do... kan!

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:22.980
Igaiga?

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:24.930
What do you mean "do... kan" mipo?

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:28.910
"Igaiga"? Does he mean the 
burrs on the chestnut?

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.070
Hasekura-kun's not here.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.170
It's past the time that 
we were supposed to meet.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.920
He canceled at the last minute?

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.610
I see... he changed his mind, after all.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.880
But if I don't tell him today...

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:48.530
Misumi-san?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.220
Good morning.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.980
What are you doing over here anyway?

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.740
Well... I...

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:58.190
I went ahead and bought us bento lunches...

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.200
It's okay with you, isn't it?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.680
Sure... It's okay.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.210
Here you go.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.630
Thanks.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:23.100
When should I tell him?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.990
Bringing it up all of a 
sudden now would be...

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:28.990
It'll be okay to wait until 
we finish picking chestnuts...

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.640
That's what I'll do.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.470
It's beautiful popo!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.280
What am I doing anyway?

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.410
Look at all the chestnuts on the ground!

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:58.890
Shall we get into the spirit 
of things, and start picking?

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:14.590
Wow! We've already got a mountain of them.

00:11:14.810 --> 00:11:17.510
This is just the beginning.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:20.420
I'm going to eat until I can't eat anymore.

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.410
First, we'll grill it, and 
have grilled chestnuts.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:24.690
What is it?

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:27.370
I knew you'd be like this.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:37.320
When I saw you at the sports 
festival, I liked what I saw.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:42.080
I like a girl with lots of spirit.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.060
You do?

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.560
Looking at them from here, 
they make a nice couple mipo.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:53.230
Nagisa's feelings are beginning to sway...

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:58.260
This is good popo.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.530
No! I'm not supposed to be picking 
chestnuts and enjoying myself.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:04.130
I have to tell him.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:05.700
Hasekura-kun!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.070
I...

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:11.610
What is it?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.100
I'll...

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.780
...go and buy some juice.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.860
Misumi-san!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.840
That's strange... Where did she go?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.690
Misumi-san!

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:50.050
I can't tell him!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.290
What am I going to do?

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:56.330
Hiding won't solve anything.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.820
Get your act together, Nagisa.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.410
Honoka?

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.630
You came?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.140
I was worried.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.450
I'm so happy!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.590
Everyone should have a close friend.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:15.450
I'll be here for you, 
so go and turn him down.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.610
There she is...

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.890
Misumi-san! I've been looking for you.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.370
I found another place where there 
are a lot of fallen chestnuts.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:26.160
Let's go.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.120
Misumi-san?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:33.090
I have to tell you something, Hasekura-kun.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:34.840
What is it?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.500
I can't...

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.380
Are you okay, Misumi-san?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.260
Ouch!

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:55.440
Zakenna!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.650
What is that?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.790
At a time like this...

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.540
Zakenna!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:03.350
This way!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:05.920
What am I going to do?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.450
I can't transform in front of Hasekura-kun.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:17.010
Hasekura-kun!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.320
Hasekura-kun...!

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.270
Hasekura-kun has nothing to do with this...

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.610
You didn't have to drag him into this.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.510
I won't forgive you!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:35.660
But didn't I make it easier 
for you to transform?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:36.600
Honoka!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.270
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.770
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.470
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.270
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.680
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.130
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.790
Zakenna!

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.890
This is no good!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.960
Zakenna!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.130
Zakenna!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:40.250
You're the ones who will get hurt if 
you get involved without thinking.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.510
What are you going to do?

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:43.860
Why ask me?

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.760
Hasekura-kun!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.340
Black!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:53.960
Hurry!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.500
Wait right here...

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.220
I'll take care of it, and be right back.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.350
White...

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:42.350
Black Thunder!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.810
White Thunder!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.390
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.230
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.720
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:24.830
I found her... My ideal!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.740
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.940
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.770
You! Wait...

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:54.820
What a great haul!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.200
Misumi-san?

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:56.610
Yes?

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:00.930
I need to talk to you.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:06.040
I have something to tell you, too.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:12.140
Go ahead...

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.930
I'm sorry, Misumi-san...

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.580
Forcing you to come to 
pick chestnuts with me.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.920
What's this all of a sudden?

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:24.050
The truth is... I found my ideal girl here.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.890
So strong...

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.300
So powerful...

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.600
A brave girl who looks good in black.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.670
She's the ideal girl that 
I've been looking for.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.180
I'm really sorry!

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:41.430
Misumi-san?

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.200
Don't worry about it.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:49.720
Actually, I came with you 
today to turn you down...

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.500
But I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.220
I see...

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.670
But I'm the one who asked you to come,

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.380
and now it turns out that...

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:02.990
No... it's my fault for not 
saying anything sooner.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:03.850
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:06.400
No, it's my fault...

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.330
You shouldn't have to apologize.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:12.240
I guess it just means that we 
weren't meant for each other...

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.500
Is that okay with you?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:18.850
But thanks to you, I had fun today.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:19.980
So did I.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.810
Thank you, Misumi-san.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.820
She might still be around here, 
so I'm going to look for her.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:30.760
Hey! You there in black... You're my ideal!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:35.210
Hasekura-kun! What am I going 
to do with all the chestnuts?

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.770
I'm sorry, Misumi-san!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.480
Can you take them to the reception area?

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.180
Hey there! Girl dressed 
in the black outfit...

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.770
Come out!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.460
He was free and easy-going 
till the end, wasn't he?

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:49.930
Either way, he was talking 
about me, wasn't he?

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:53.410
It looks like Black left a stronger 
impression on him, didn't she?

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.360
But they're both me...

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.530
He dumped you, and fell in love at 
first sight with Black this time mepo.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.640
Aren't you glad mipo?

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:01.960
You're so popular mipo!

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:04.870
You'll never be this popular 
again in your life mepo.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:13.020
It's not funny at all!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.550
I'm exhausted.

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.730
It was a rough birthday for you, wasn't it?

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:26.620
That's right. Today was my birthday!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.820
Nothing good happened.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.270
Honoka! Misumi-san!

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:35.140
Fuji-P...?

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:38.120
Did you two go out together?

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:41.090
I guess you could say that...

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:43.980
By the way, Fujimura-kun...

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.030
Today is Nagisa's birthday.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:48.100
Is it?

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.370
Yes...

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:54.220
Happy Birthday, Misumi-san.

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:03.430
I'd better be going.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.110
He...

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:09.840
He ...wished me a happy birthday.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.120
Aren't you glad?

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.170
By the way, what about the bento 
lunch you hurt your finger making?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.280
It's not what you think!

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:23.950
But you woke up early to make 
the bento lunch, didn't you?

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:26.270
What did you make anyway?

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:27.970
Nothing much...

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:30.670
Thank you for the meal popo.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:35.570
Honoka... The bento lunch that 
Nagisa made was delicious popo.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:40.200
The best one was the rice ball 
with the chocolate in the middle.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:43.620
And the rice ball with jam 
inside was delicious, too popo.

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:46.020
Nagisa's a genius when 
it comes to cooking popo.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:50.200
But I don't think you should put round 
hard candy in your rice balls popo.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.850
Nagisa... were you going to let him eat that?

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:58.390
I thought it would convince 
Hasekura-kun it give up on me.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.910
But they were all edible.

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:02.850
Nagisa! You're weird!

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:16.960
I have to find a way to escape 
while the three of them are away.

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:55.140
Pollun is communicating?

00:23:55.140 --> 00:23:56.030
Who is it this time?

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:56.720
This voice...

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:57.630
Stone Keeper!

00:23:57.630 --> 00:23:59.370
Does that mean that he escaped?

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:00.720
Where is he now?

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:02.270
Don't you sense anything, Mepple?

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:03.480
I don't care what it is. Just tell me.

00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:05.860
Flowers? I can't figure it out with that.

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:07.260
Look, Nagisa... The forest...

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:07.900
The forest is...

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:08.780
It's moving!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:13.100
"REACH FOR FREEDOM! 
STONE KEEPER'S DESPERATE GREAT ESCAPE"

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:14.090
Flowers? What do you mean by that?

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:15.790
Help me figure it out, Nagisa!

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:17.120
It might just come to us.

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:19.010
We don't have time to do that!
